| Alert Hash Database  | Leave Blank                                                |
| Ignore Hash Database | Leave Blank                                                |

Click:

```text id="f6p1zt"
Next
```

---

## Step 22: Add Disk Image

1. Select:

   ```text id="k5x7mw"
